      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `0925bf11226b7690761093e5cb2a4e59740d3dc0eab2ffa2b37ea4087bf4e107--prisoners-australia-2017-cube-3-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Prisoners in Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2017\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | eb533ed911af239befa0bcb24e7bf18f39bab98830b45076484e12934aa78112 | missing |\n| \"Table_36\" | 9f1cf24e6c189d2361a44c5cf6112a7bbfa47c974571dbb29cd4a356847e800d | missing |\n| \"Table_37\" | 81d7e36e841c0f87aabe3e9cb912f4a857c61a06d2351437e79464f38dacea4a | missing |\n| \"Table_38\" | 206a5709580b95c0d665b28c212eacbeca87c8fac7c7d73469bfa3364a69fb4e | missing |\n| \"Table_39\" | b7f7d8c0a4d4224fe8a9bbcda94b587ebd028743fa877b33cc8d93c59b49c35b | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 5762e014cd5a737ea7917e43b757eda5e0c2dd8de5d9d3fa9704f15f0691478f | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
